actualResponse:
{
  "answer": "Set the client’s base URL to your local server, e.g. `http://localhost:3456/v1`.

Python:
```python
from openai import OpenAI
client = OpenAI(base_url="http://localhost:3456/v1", api_key="dummy")
```

JavaScript:
```js
import OpenAI from "openai";
const client = new OpenAI({
  baseURL: "http://localhost:3456/v1",
  apiKey: "dummy",
});
```

If your local runtime doesn’t require auth, many clients still require some non-empty `api_key`/`apiKey` value."
}

